# Shoot4Fun — environment variables
#
# The backend reads DATABASE_URL from the environment. Without it the
# leaderboard and the profile store are in-memory (their per-claim tests
# use in-process fixtures). The platform mints pg-app-shoot4fun via the
# onboarding database grant and injects DATABASE_URL via the Helm chart.
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://pg-app-shoot4fun@pg-cluster:5432/shoot4fun
